Z||000000||Huck||09-14-2001||12:47 AM||||Hey London Fiero owners... just a note to say that there is one more fiero in the city now.  I moved down for school a couple weeks ago, and have noticed a few fiero's around so far.  If you've seen me in my 87 silver GT you'd likely remember me..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  Either I honked, waved, or swerved at you..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif">.  I've actually seen 2 fiero's on my street (Kipps LAne) in the last 3 days... freaky..<P>Main thing I want to know is who has a White GT Fastback, spoiler and rims (it was dark!) and who has a GT Fastback (Burnt Orange) at Fanshawe college... I've had to stop and drool a couple times at those cars..  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>Huck<BR>87 Silver GT T-top||||reg||14
